and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\\)</span> is the typed validity predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aa3cbc444df6275\" href=\"?note=2aa3cbc444df6275\" title=\"93-df-validity\">93-df-validity</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the first-order formula set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K:\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\n\\varphi;\\mathcal L\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K:\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\n\\varphi;\\mathcal L\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The nontrivial right-to-left direction is supplied by the finite model property; the other direction follows from class i